  "description": {
   "content": [
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "When I run the Fedora rebuild utility as a less-privileged user, it prints a warning when it can't write to fedora-internal-use/fedora-internal-use-backend-service-policies (and this warning doesn't seem to interfere with the rebuild functionality). I'm surprised the rebuild utility would need that write access in the first place.",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "Here's the stack trace:",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "[lyberadmin@sul-dor-dev home]$ server/bin/fedora-rebuild.sh ",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "Fedora Rebuild Utility",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "..........................",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "WARNING: Live rebuilds are not currently supported.",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "Make sure your server is stopped before continuing.",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "Server directory is /home/lyberadmin/apps/fedora/home/server",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "---------------------------------------------------------------------\n",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "ERROR 10:01:22.723 (PolicyFinderModule) Error loading repository policies: java.io.FileNotFoundException: /home/lyberadmin/apps/fedora/home/server/fedora-internal-use/fedora-internal-use-backend-service-policies/callback-by_default.xml (Permission denied)",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "java.io.FileNotFoundException: /home/lyberadmin/apps/fedora/home/server/fedora-internal-use/fedora-internal-use-backend-service-policies/callback-by_default.xml (Permission denied)",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "at java.io.FileOutputStream.open(Native Method) ~[na:1.6.0_33]",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
