  "description": "<p>When I run the Fedora rebuild utility as a less-privileged user, it prints a warning when it can't write to fedora-internal-use/fedora-internal-use-backend-service-policies (and this warning doesn't seem to interfere with the rebuild functionality). I'm surprised the rebuild utility would need that write access in the first place.</p>\n\n\n<p>Here's the stack trace:<br/>\n<span class=\"error\">&#91;lyberadmin@sul-dor-dev home&#93;</span>$ server/bin/fedora-rebuild.sh </p>\n\n<p>                       Fedora Rebuild Utility<br/>\n                     ..........................</p>\n\n<p>WARNING: Live rebuilds are not currently supported.<br/>\n         Make sure your server is stopped before continuing.</p>\n\n<p>Server directory is /home/lyberadmin/apps/fedora/home/server</p>\n\n<p>---------------------------------------------------------------------</p>\n\n<p>ERROR 10:01:22.723 (PolicyFinderModule) Error loading repository policies: java.io.FileNotFoundException: /home/lyberadmin/apps/fedora/home/server/fedora-internal-use/fedora-internal-use-backend-service-policies/callback-by_default.xml (Permission denied)<br/>\njava.io.FileNotFoundException: /home/lyberadmin/apps/fedora/home/server/fedora-internal-use/fedora-internal-use-backend-service-policies/callback-by_default.xml (Permission denied)<br/>\n\tat java.io.FileOutputStream.open(Native Method) ~<span class=\"error\">&#91;na:1.6.0_33&#93;</span><br/>\n\tat java.io.FileOutputStream.&lt;init&gt;(FileOutputStream.java:194) ~<span class=\"error\">&#91;na:1.6.0_33&#93;</span><br/>\n\tat java.io.FileOutputStream.&lt;init&gt;(FileOutputStream.java:84) ~<span class=\"error\">&#91;na:1.6.0_33&#93;</span><br/>\n\tat org.fcrepo.server.security.PolicyFinderModule.generateBackendPolicies(PolicyFinderModule.java:241) ~<span class=\"error\">&#91;fcrepo-server-3.6.jar:na&#93;</span><br/>\n\tat org.fcrepo.server.security.PolicyFinderModule.setupActivePolicyDirectories(PolicyFinderModule.java:264) ~<span class=\"error\">&#91;fcrepo-server-3.6.jar:na&#93;</span><br/>\n\tat org.fcrepo.server.security.PolicyFinderModule.init(PolicyFinderModule.java:205) ~<span class=\"error\">&#91;fcrepo-server-3.6.jar:na&#93;</span><br/>\n\tat com.sun.xacml.finder.PolicyFinder.init(PolicyFinder.java:143) <span class=\"error\">&#91;sunxacml-1.2-melcoe.jar:na&#93;</span><br/>\n\tat com.sun.xacml.PDP.&lt;init&gt;(PDP.java:102) <span class=\"error\">&#91;sunxacml-1.2-melcoe.jar:na&#93;</span><br/>\n\tat org.fcrepo.server.security.impl.AbstractPolicyEnforcementPoint.newPdp(AbstractPolicyEnforcementPoint.java:77) <span class=\"error\">&#91;fcrepo-server-3.6.jar:na&#93;</span><br/>\n\tat org.fcrepo.server.security.impl.AbstractPolicyEnforcementPoint.init(AbstractPolicyEnforcementPoint.java:72) <span class=\"error\">&#91;fcrepo-server-3.6.jar:na&#93;</span><br/>\n\tat sun.reflect.NativeMethodAccessorImpl.invoke0(Native Method) ~<span class=\"error\">&#91;na:1.6.0_33&#93;</span><br/>\n\tat sun.reflect.NativeMethodAccessorImpl.invoke(NativeMethodAccessorImpl.java:39) ~<span class=\"error\">&#91;na:1.6.0_33&#93;</span></p>",
